["Water Way to Go!"]={description="Ohbiru-Dohburu is running out of the Giddeus water needed to raise Fluoro-flora. He wants you to take a Rhinostery canteen to the springs at the back off Giddeus in order to refill his supply.",fame="Windurst",fame_level="3",id=16,next={"Blue Ribbon Blues"},previous={"Overnight Delivery"},repeatable="Yes",requirements={{count=1,id=4351,name="Canteen of Giddeus water"}},reward="900 Gil",start_npc="Ohbiru-Dohbiru",start_pos="J-9",start_zone="Windurst Waters"},
["Wild Card"]={description="You have been asked to take apart the Joker Cardian and steal its Mana Orb. But... Where, o where has the Joker gone? O where, o where can he be?",fame="Windurst",fame_level="6",id=77,next={"The Promise"},previous={"Crying Over Onions"},requirements={{count=1,id=1057,name="Toraimarai Coffer Key"}},reward="8,000 gil",start_npc="Honoi-Gomoi",start_pos="E-7",start_zone="Windurst Waters South",title="Dream Dweller"},
["Wonder Wands"]={description="The black, white, and red mage brigades of the War Warlocks are arguing over how the Orastery's budget should be spent. The captains of the three brigades each want you to obtain a sample of the wands they want so they can decide which to buy.",fame="Windurst",id=48,previous={"Making Amens!"},reward="New Moon Armlets\n4800g",start_npc="Hakkuru-Rinkuru",start_pos="E-7",start_zone="Port Windurst",title="Doctor Shantotto's Guinea Pig"},
